| 2 | ZSTD_CCtxParams_setParameter | `ZSTD_c_format` value < `ZSTD_f_zstd1`(0) or > `ZSTD_f_zstd1_magicless`(1) (BOUNDCHECK), compress/zstd_compress.c:776 | `ZSTD_error_parameter_outOfBound` |
